  "description_snippet": "## Summary\n\nANGLE's `ValidImageDataSize` function fails to account for `CubeMapArray` when computing `endByte`, treating it as a 2D upload instead of a 3D one. This causes the PBO bounds check and the robust-variant `bufSize` check to use an underestimated byte count, allowing undersized source buff"
